roportioned glazing. A limestone-toned terrace expands beside the veranda for dining and lounging, while a modest swimming pool is set within the garden court with clear sightlines from the social rooms.","landscape":"The flat site is treated as a restrained Mediterranean garden: clipped low hedging, gravel-edged planting beds, small groups of drought-tolerant shrubs, aromatic herbs and a limited number of slender shade trees. Planting frames the sheltered court, softens pool edges and preserves open arrival space around the connected house volumes.","palette":{"walls":"ivory","accent":"limestone","roof":"bronze","roofColor":"#B65A36","deck":"limestone"}}
